---
/**
 * About Page
 *
 * Displays Andy Woods' complete professional biography, including current role,
 * background, expertise, and contact information.
 */
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About - Andy Woods"
  description="Head of Product at DualEntry, the first AI-native ERP. Previously scaled CockroachDB from pre-revenue to $100M+ ARR."
>
  {/* Header */}
  <section class="mb-8">
    <h1 class="font-sans text-4xl font-bold mb-8 text-black">About Me</h1>

    {/* Profile photo - centered on mobile, floated right on desktop */}
    <img
      src="/profile.jpg"
      alt="Andy Woods"
      class="w-48 h-48 rounded-lg object-cover shadow-lg mb-6 md:float-right md:ml-8 md:mb-4"
    />

    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-4">
      I'm Head of Product at{' '}
      <a
        href="https://www.dualentry.com/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="text-black underline hover:opacity-70"
      >
        DualEntry
      </a>
      , an AI-native ERP for finance teams. I lead product management, design, product marketing,
      and education.{' '}
      <a
        href="https://www.khoslaventures.com/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="text-black underline hover:opacity-70"
      >
        Khosla Ventures
      </a>{' '}
      and{' '}
      <a
        href="https://lsvp.com/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="text-black underline hover:opacity-70"
      >
        Lightspeed
      </a>{' '}
      co-led our $90M Series A, with{' '}
      <a
        href="https://www.gv.com/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="text-black underline hover:opacity-70"
      >
        GV (Google Ventures)
      </a>
      , Contrary, and Vesey Ventures participating.
    </p>

    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-4">
      At DualEntry I've shipped{' '}
      <a
        href="https://docs.dualentry.com/accountants/get-started"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="text-black underline hover:opacity-70"
      >
        docs
      </a>{' '}
      for every surface of the product: guides for accountants and controllers, the API reference,
      the{' '}
      <a
        href="https://github.com/dualentry/dualentry-cli"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="text-black underline hover:opacity-70"
      >
        CLI
      </a>
      , and the MCP server. I also run product development with agents doing the repetitive work.
      When we lose a deal, an agent scores the loss from the call recordings, I meet with the buyer,
      and agents turn that conversation into Linear projects tagged to the customer. PM time goes to
      customers and decisions instead of write-ups.
    </p>

    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-4">
      Before DualEntry, I spent 8.5 years at{' '}
      <a
        href="https://www.cockroachlabs.com/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="text-black underline hover:opacity-70"
      >
        Cockroach Labs
      </a>
      , from pre-revenue through $100M+ ARR. I led cross-functional teams of 50+ on the Application
      and Database Ecosystem, which covered CockroachDB's integrations for observability, disaster
      recovery, change data capture (CDC), streaming, and migration across hybrid and cloud
      environments. I led the company's first AI product initiative and owned pricing and packaging
      strategy.
    </p>

    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-4">
      I write here about how I build products with AI, from prototypes to production.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="font-sans text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-black">Background</h2>

    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
      I have 15+ years in product development and people leadership, and a Kellogg MBA in analytics,
      finance, and marketing.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="font-sans text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-black">Subject Matter Expertise</h2>

    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-lg text-gray-700">
      <li>
        AI-native product development: agents in the product workflow, LLMs, MCP, and production
        deployment
      </li>
      <li>Finance and ERP workflows, from startups to public companies</li>
      <li>Enterprise B2B across SaaS, open-core, and enterprise licensing models</li>
      <li>Go-to-market: product-led growth, sales-assisted motions, and field sales enablement</li>
      <li>Distributed infrastructure and databases, including AWS, GCP, and Azure integrations</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="font-sans text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-black">Technical & Strategic Skills</h2>

    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-lg text-gray-700">
      <li>
        People leadership: hiring, coaching, and performance management across product, design,
        product marketing, and education
      </li>
      <li>Product strategy: investment planning, ROI analysis, budgeting, and analytics</li>
      <li>End-to-end product development, from discovery and design to docs and delivery</li>
      <li>
        Analytics and financial modeling: SQL and Looker, revenue forecasting, NRR/NDR, gross
        margin, LTV:CAC, Rule of 40
      </li>
      <li>
        Pricing and monetization informed by data science, customer research, and business modeling
      </li>
      <li>Technical: Python, SQL, Claude, Claude Code, MCP, GPT, Gemini</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="font-sans text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-black">Let's Connect</h2>

    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-4">
      Happy to talk AI, finance software, product, or the perfect burger. Reach out on{' '}
      <a
        href="https://x.com/iamandywoods"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="text-black underline hover:opacity-70"
      >
        X
      </a>{' '}
      or{' '}
      <a
        href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/andrewscottwoods/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="text-black underline hover:opacity-70"
      >
        LinkedIn
      </a>
      .
    </p>

    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
      I advise early-stage companies on AI product strategy, 0-1 and 1-10 product development, and
      B2B software. I speak at conferences about building AI-native products, modern product
      management, and rebuilding finance and infrastructure software with AI.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="font-sans text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-black">About This Site</h2>

    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-4">
      I built this site with{' '}
      <a
        href="https://claude.com/claude-code"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="text-black underline hover:opacity-70"
      >
        Claude Code
      </a>{' '}
      and{' '}
      <a
        href="https://astro.build"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="text-black underline hover:opacity-70"
      >
        Astro
      </a>{' '}
      in under 4 hours. Blog hero images are generated with{' '}
      <a
        href="https://stability.ai/stable-diffusion"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="text-black underline hover:opacity-70"
      >
        Stable Diffusion
      </a>{' '}
      to match each article.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
